    "about": {
      "title": "About EduBridge",
      "subtitle": "A platform designed to simplify access to higher education in Tunisia",
      "description1": "EduBridge is a Tunisian digital platform dedicated to connecting candidates with private higher education institutions in Tunisia. It covers all programs: preparatory cycles, bachelor's degrees, engineering cycles and master's degrees — in fields as varied as computer science, civil engineering, electrical, mechanical and many others.",
